      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">Local SEO for landscapers: how the <span style="color:var(--primary)">map pack</span> decides who gets the call</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Almost nobody scrolls past the three businesses in the map. For a landscaping company, local SEO is not a general internet strategy — it is the specific work of getting into that box in the neighborhoods your trucks already drive through.</p>
    </div>
